    "gallery_carousel_fePLai": {
      "type": "gallery-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "image_fcRTDT": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/15.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "SP 105",
            "text": "<p>Simple, dependable, and built for performance. The SP 105 is our most popular triathlon build, equipped with Shimano’s trusted 105 mechanical groupset. Perfect for first-time triathletes and racers chasing new PRs, it delivers reliability and speed without breaking the bank.</p>"
          }
        },
        "image_H4DEnB": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/16.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "SP Rival AXS",
            "text": "<p>A step up from the 105, the SP Rival AXS boasts precise, electronic shifting from SRAM. Streamlined and efficient, the SP Rival AXS wants to take on tough training blocks and tackle Ironman bike legs. </p>"
          }
        },
        "image_E67RDw": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/14.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "SP Force AXS",
            "text": "<p>Many of our pro and AG triathletes tend to love the SP Force AXS because of its incredibly high performance, without completely breaking the bank on SRAM's Red AXS. This build is a great blend of effective and premium, and is one of our most popular choices for those who are looking to race fast in 70.3s and full Ironmans. </p>"
          }
        },
        "image_NLXyQf": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/17.png",
            "focal_point": "image_presentation",
            "title": "SP Red AXS",
            "text": "<p>The SP Red AXS is the pinnacle of speed, performance, and excellence. SRAM's Red AXS groupset is its lightest, most meticulous components, this build is for those who want to race at a high level, break their PRs, and compete. Comes with Zipp's 808 Firecrest carbon wheels. </p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
